{"title":"괴물","artist":"YOASOBI","sourceId":"reference:Hz5cwz3y3jyVy6PkZKzQ","sourceHash":"6d61f5c3d90137d6aba12eb6a6bccad636c345fa65aa17a421706a7eb5ca07ea","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36863681,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.19,"end":4.54,"text":"あぁ素晴らしき世界に今日も乾杯","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.54,"end":7.19,"text":"街に飛び交う笑い声も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":7.19,"end":11.62,"text":"見て見ぬフリしてるだけの作りもんさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.62,"end":13.04,"text":"気が触れそうだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":13.04,"end":15.68,"text":"クラクラするほどの良い匂いが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":15.68,"end":18.05,"text":"ツンと刺した鼻の奥","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":18.05,"end":19.93,"text":"目を覚ます本能のまま","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":19.93,"end":22.83,"text":"今日は誰の番だ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":22.83,"end":26.68,"text":"この世界で何が出来るのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":26.68,"end":29.65,"text":"僕には何が出来るのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":29.65,"end":32.35,"text":"ただその真っ黒な目から","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":32.35,"end":35.37,"text":"涙溢れ落ちないように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":35.37,"end":38.62,"text":"あぁ願う未来に何度でもずっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":38.62,"end":39.71,"text":"喰らいつく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":39.71,"end":43.91,"text":"この間違いだらけの世界の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":43.91,"end":47.14,"text":"君には笑ってほしいから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":47.14,"end":49.26,"text":"もう誰も傷付けない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":49.26,"end":51.92,"text":"強く強くなりたいんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":51.92,"end":57.15,"text":"僕が僕でいられるように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":63.62,"end":66.63,"text":"素晴らしき世界は今日も安泰","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":66.63,"end":69.41,"text":"街に渦巻く悪い話も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":69.41,"end":73.57,"text":"知らない知らないフリして目を逸らした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":73.57,"end":75.72,"text":"正気の沙汰じゃないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":75.72,"end":77.93,"text":"真面目に着飾った行進","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":77.93,"end":80.83,"text":"鳴らす足音が弾む行き先は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":80.83,"end":84.98,"text":"消えない消えない味が染み付いている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":84.98,"end":88.06,"text":"裏側の世界","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":97.85,"end":100.28999999999999,"text":"清く正しく生きること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":100.28999999999999,"end":102.84,"text":"誰も悲しませずに生きること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":102.84,"end":105.78999999999999,"text":"はみ出さず真っ直ぐに生きること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":105.78999999999999,"end":108.67,"text":"それが間違わないで生きること？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":108.67,"end":111.38,"text":"ありのまま生きることが正義か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":111.38,"end":114.28,"text":"騙し騙し生きるのは正義か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":114.28,"end":117.0,"text":"僕の在るべき姿とはなんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":117.0,"end":119.63,"text":"本当の僕は何者なんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":119.63,"end":122.66,"text":"教えてくれよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":125.27,"end":128.34,"text":"教えてくれよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":130.96,"end":131.76,"text":"今日も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":131.76,"end":134.61,"text":"答えのない世界の中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":134.61,"end":136.24,"text":"願ってるんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":136.24,"end":137.92000000000002,"text":"不器用だけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":137.92000000000002,"end":141.17000000000002,"text":"いつまでも君とただ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":141.17000000000002,"end":142.91,"text":"笑っていたいから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":142.91,"end":145.25,"text":"あぁ跳ねる心臓が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":145.25,"end":147.99,"text":"体揺らし叫ぶんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":147.99,"end":150.93,"text":"今こそ動き出せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":150.93,"end":154.29,"text":"あぁ弱い自分を何度でもずっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":154.29,"end":155.35,"text":"喰らい尽くす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":155.35,"end":159.66,"text":"この間違いだらけの世界の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":159.66,"end":162.81,"text":"君には笑ってほしいから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":162.81,"end":165.18,"text":"もう誰も泣かないよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":165.18,"end":167.77,"text":"強く強くなりたいんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":167.77,"end":174.04,"text":"僕が僕でいられるように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":181.99,"end":184.91,"text":"ただ君を守るそのために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":184.91,"end":187.4,"text":"走る走る走るんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":187.4,"end":190.84,"text":"僕の中の僕を超える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}